      "cooked": "<p>So, I’ve had an on and off again thing of going through the character creation methods of different games and making a gorgon archer. The current incarnation of the blog exists on tumblr and Sentinels Comics RPG was the first gorgon archer I made in this incarnation of the blog:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.tumblr.com/gorgonarcher/737902986141024256/game-1-sentinels-comics?source=share\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/084cd0ac3c4a872d91cfcfe287bed85fb02bec49.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/gorgonarcher/737902986141024256/game-1-sentinels-comics?source=share\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tumblr</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/227;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f7a65a431847fbda7e0df2c9b7834794c0c3ef28_2_690x227.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"227\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f7a65a431847fbda7e0df2c9b7834794c0c3ef28_2_690x227.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f7a65a431847fbda7e0df2c9b7834794c0c3ef28.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f7a65a431847fbda7e0df2c9b7834794c0c3ef28.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f7a65a431847fbda7e0df2c9b7834794c0c3ef28_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/gorgonarcher/737902986141024256/game-1-sentinels-comics?source=share\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Game 1 - Sentinels Comics</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Just because it's on the mind, let's start with Sentinels Comics which is the RPG based on the card game Sentinels of the Multiverse.\n\nSentinels Comics has one of the most well-done and interesting r…</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
