      "created_at": "2024-07-08T01:02:32.429Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have another general gaming blog where I’ve occasionally done Sentinels stuff… but it’s mostly just more character builds and the occasional play report of the card game:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.tumblr.com/thryth-gaming/754971988092665856/trying-to-gather-post-links?source=share\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/87302c79cab89d6ba01dd9ecf2027331bffd509e.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/thryth-gaming/754971988092665856/trying-to-gather-post-links?source=share\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tumblr</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/thryth-gaming/754971988092665856/trying-to-gather-post-links?source=share\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Trying to Gather post links</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Monster of the Week stuff\n\nCanton Crew moves\n\nRyoko Saotome for MotW\n\nSa for MotW\n\nHunter Team based on Spotify listening stats\n\nKatalepsis Reframed as MotW series\n\nCanton Crew Timeline\n\nLate Start K…</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>I’m unlikely to do more Sentinels stuff on there since I’m trying not to dilute it from the Gorgon Archer stuff.</p>",
